# Client-supplied asset archives � keep local, we only commit the
# unpacked images referenced by the app.
public/op-icons/**/*.zip
# Mockup source screenshots kept locally for re-cropping icons; we only
# commit the derived per-icon PNGs.
public/op-icons/**/source/

# scripts/responsive-audit.cjs --screenshot output — local debugging
# artifacts, never committed.
.responsive-audit/


# Security/launch review finding #14 (2026-11-14): keep stray one-off
